  "worked_solution": "When we divide the two functions, we get a constant, and the limit of a constant is just the constant itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)} & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(10{x}^{8})}{(2{x}^{8})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }5 \\\\  & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$",
